{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a wilderness survival game, a 2D survival game. Players need to combine different items to survive in the dangerous and cold wilderness.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Introduction\u200b</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull the lever each round, and the wheel will rotate randomly, giving players values of health, attack, defense, warmth, body temperature, satiety and thirst.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select items to add to the backpack. Double-click to transfer items from the backpack to the warehouse, or from the warehouse to the backpack.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move to other places to survive every 6 rounds, and face new opportunities or challenges at the same time.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The temperature will keep dropping every day, and players need to get more items to survive.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891370?t=1754480507","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891370/06359befce15172a357c07d3abb4c248787ad55a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754480507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891370/ebcb1ebfc62c096cd5ed7b5286e2a5114b1d3b09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754480507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891370/ebcb1ebfc62c096cd5ed7b5286e2a5114b1d3b09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754480507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a wilderness survival game, a 2D survival game. Players need to combine different items to survive in the dangerous and cold wilderness.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Introduction\u200b</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull the lever each round, and the wheel will rotate randomly, giving players values of health, attack, defense, warmth, body temperature, satiety and thirst.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select items to add to the backpack. Double-click to transfer items from the backpack to the warehouse, or from the warehouse to the backpack.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move to other places to survive every 6 rounds, and face new opportunities or challenges at the same time.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The temperature will keep dropping every day, and players need to get more items to survive.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Qi Jun"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891370/bd2296b9585685aaba7c928bce7936e103c9fa63/header.jpg?t=1754480507","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891370/76761878/f253ad3126d6da3c2357938f54b6657e0074d78d/1753754164/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754480505","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891370/76761878/f253ad3126d6da3c2357938f54b6657e0074d78d/1753754164/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754480505","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3891370/76761878/f253ad3126d6da3c2357938f54b6657e0074d78d/1753754164/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754480505","id":257175088,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175088/m